kwin-autoscroll (0.1.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add configurable glyph sizing with KDE-style previews.
  * Add seven selectable anchor and directional pointer styles, with Breeze
    Dark as the default.
  * Apply visual changes immediately without restarting an active session.

