kwin-autoscroll (0.1.3-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Require two physical wheel events to cancel AutoScroll while preserving
    immediate click and Escape cancellation.

 -- elecxyz <elecxyz@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 08:30:00 +0800

kwin-autoscroll (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a configurable modifier for middle-click activation so plain
    middle-click can remain available for opening browser links and paste.
  * Wait for the activation button and modifier to be released before
    generating scroll events, avoiding modified-wheel actions such as zoom.

 -- elecxyz <elecxyz@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:30:00 +0800

